  <ym-title|Actual corrected body compiler \V draft
  evidence><label|actual-corrected-body-compiler--draft-evidence>

  Parent-authored under issue #26, session hairer-codex-existence-20261111,
  confirmed claim until 2026-11-12 16:40 UTC. Source pin
  <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>. Text:
  <verbatim|manuscript/existence/actual-corrected-body-compiler.tex>.
  Unintegrated candidate; independent mathematical/correspondence review
  requested.

  <section|Scope><label|scope>

  Construct the same actual value-order corrected Plate from the eight
  exponent contributions, bounded owner extension and simultaneous
  motion/gauge averaging; verify the literal positive loading and genuine P
  density identity; apply the canonical all-hole/white-P marked machinery on
  that same alphabet. Not a fresh all-order activity proof. Hefts on actual
  harvested ceilings and Pupil on every Matched palette remain explicit
  prerequisites, not established by this section. The actual Certified,
  Fund.Stock, noises, parcels at 0 and 1, path/clip equalities,
  Footprint.reserve and Lawful data are also retained and must be bound
  globally.

  <section|Source inspected><label|source-inspected>

  All paths below begin <verbatim|Lean/YM/PhysicalNext/AFTERNOON_INTERACTING_RANK_COMPARISON/>.
  Fully read Gush, Regale, Petty, Prism, Gardener, Sage and Unlid; targeted
  earlier reads of Enigma, Shards, Turret, Plotter, Offers, French, Crust;
  reread source declarations for exact namespace distinctions. The
  independent minimal primitive audit in <verbatim|reviews/closure-audit.md>
  supplies the wider same-compiler crosswalk.

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item><verbatim|Opacity/Gush.lean>, namespace
    <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.InteractingRank.Pump>: <verbatim|tenders>,
    <verbatim|posting>, <verbatim|issued>, <verbatim|paltry>,
    <verbatim|Helps>, <verbatim|foreshadows> (plus private
    <verbatim|discounts>, <verbatim|drives>, <verbatim|drought>). Literal
    t=q+q+y^4 nu+(q+(nu+nu))+q+a, a=y^(-1/24), 2t\<less\>=y^(-1/48),
    t\<less\>=1. BetaF/retime are not interchanged.

    <item><verbatim|Opacity/Petty.lean>, same Pump namespace:
    <verbatim|Petty>, <verbatim|Petty.accepts>, <verbatim|Petty.receives>,
    <verbatim|Petty.acceptsList>, <verbatim|issue_invoice>. Nonempty
    supports, nonnegative prices and e\<gtr\>=0 imply summability before
    fiber grouping. Clamp before common gauge/motion averaging; extension
    agrees only on Playing.

    <item><verbatim|Opacity/Regale.lean>, same namespace:
    <verbatim|Petty.walk>, <verbatim|slack>, <verbatim|Ancestor.abound>
    (private <verbatim|altitude>, <verbatim|cache>). Fine path rates are at
    the actual weakened retimed band; the inherited estimate retains its
    reserve, LaneCounts, Bc\<less\>=walls, Bf\<less\>=2Bc, beta\<less\>=4y,
    threshold\<less\>=2fiery and Lawful bounds. Total
    \<less\>=(1+2<em|k>l+3*k)y^(-1/12)\<less\>=y^(-1/24).

    <item><verbatim|Opacity/Sage.lean>, namespace <verbatim|...Pump.Port>:
    <verbatim|froth>, <verbatim|paid_froth>, <verbatim|satin>,
    <verbatim|lining>, <verbatim|tallyQ>, <verbatim|results>,
    <verbatim|reproduces>, <verbatim|fareCity>, <verbatim|bolsters>. Two
    Gaussian coordinates contribute y^4; the linear residual contributes
    y^(-4)*y^2=y^(-2); Haar log uses the extended min(norm,4arc) estimate.

    <item><verbatim|Opacity/Shards.lean>, same Port namespace:
    <verbatim|introTax>, <verbatim|showTax>, <verbatim|billIt>. Actual
    determinant word inventories at orders 1 and 0; both retained.

    <item><verbatim|Opacity/Enigma.lean>, same Port namespace:
    <verbatim|rents>, <verbatim|nightly>, <verbatim|bills>, <verbatim|wages>.
    Frozen local charge vanishes outside warm owner region; actual Stock
    supplies local prelude price. <verbatim|Opacity/Turret.lean> is instead
    in <verbatim|...Pump.Coffer>, with <verbatim|penury> and
    <verbatim|lapse>/owner-ceiling decomposition.

    <item><verbatim|Opacity/Prism.lean>, namespace <verbatim|...Pump.Dyed>:
    <verbatim|loading>, <verbatim|keptEarly>, <verbatim|spoolLift>,
    <verbatim|freight>, <verbatim|charge_eq>, <verbatim|cardinal_spin>.
    Loading uses the fixed reference forest/tag kinetic determinant and free
    count. Cardinal spin reconstructs original P.exponent, never white(P).
    The quadratic guide, fine cutR and coarse banker cancellation are
    displayed in the prose.

    <item><verbatim|Opacity/Gardener.lean>, namespace
    <verbatim|...Pump.Vale>: <verbatim|births>, <verbatim|cropping>,
    <verbatim|backyard>, <verbatim|rect>, <verbatim|land>. Unique owner
    decorations, finite connected partition, actual fine flags; off Playing
    both sides vanish without division. Retains bp.threshold=temp y,
    W\<gtr\>0, fiery\<gtr\>0, source threshold\<gtr\>=fiery/2, Certified,
    literal fine path/clip, LocalRatio and beta\<gtr\>0.

    <item><verbatim|Soft/Unlid.lean>, namespace
    <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.InteractingRank.Soft>: <verbatim|Kiln>,
    <verbatim|stove>, <verbatim|Arise>, <verbatim|arousing>. One BodyGrant(P)
    and Holdings before every finite marked family; ReturnTrip and Resin on
    white(P). The two arousing applications only weaken prices/multipliers of
    the same compiler. Canonical allarity-planted/restarted-rank-history
    supply the algebra; exact incoming Veins, Lease, Resin and Coupler
    receipts are not produced by this identity calculation alone.
  </itemize-minus>

  <section|Reuse and status><label|reuse-and-status>

  Reuse <verbatim|gaussian-reassembly.tex>,
  <verbatim|inherited-activity-prices.tex>,
  <verbatim|allarity-planted-compiler.tex>,
  <verbatim|restarted-rank-history.tex>, and the reviewed
  <verbatim|actual-mixed-marked-compiler.tex>. Existing local-mean,
  determinant, chart and warning chapters supply the general mechanisms. No
  new external mathematical result is invoked: the new proof consists of
  scalar payments, bounded extension, finite grouping and exact same-data
  substitutions. No whole-Lean-tree scan, source edits, Lean build or axiom
  replay. No TeX build yet for this candidate. Review must verify the eight
  actual value-price applications and note any remaining premise match rather
  than treating the displayed table as a producer.

